# 0.26.4, statics P2 (`volec fix --only statics --group FILE`): the tools'
# statics into tools::ctx::Tcx, made once per process by main (and
# cli::run::run), so that what persists across a batch's or the LSP's
# commands still does. Left out (P4): the statics whose users front, base
# or places reach through a hook (tools/statics/README).
